"halls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La villa appare decisamente diversa rispetto a quando Giselle mi accompagnava tra i suoi "
"saloni."

#: search2:search2_C56DA4F8_1A75_46EB_ADAA_B7EA8720943F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97671153aae5d407f8cf484e9457993e4b21aa71705c108deacf6599591c4ae7
