msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Blood of unknown origin not only covers the floor,⟪k:2⟫but also streams down the walls "
"and drips from the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sangue di origine sconosciuta non solo ricopre il pavimento,⟪k:2⟫ma scorre anche sui "
"muri, e cola dal soffitto."

#: search2:search2_C0DC5FF1_0C16_4E74_9924_A253D589E779
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab80bc56ad987c46a9ad50d77ebfff984b5a3ada3d9f4f1a8b5b3105f9339d88
