msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ tutto così... ⟪k:3⟫irreale."

#: search2:search2_44E62CF9_E6C3_4C50_AEAB_30D5C2F230FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d60b9c09acfa59b7ce007552ba54b25575c81320a199c03e6cf7d611280a881
